ld(t)\n\tget_parent().remove_child(self)\n\nfunc do_stuff() -> void:\n\tif tween:\n\t\ttween.kill()\n\t\n\ttween = create_tween()\n\ttween.tween_property(self, \"position:x\", 1.0, 1.0)\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[repo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21735046/repo.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"samsface","id":4586101,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODYxMDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4586101?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface","html_url":"https://github.com/samsface","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109543/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109543/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}